From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: P80 builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Use the wide welcome layout from 840dp

The wide welcome screen puts the logo and the title (57sp) in one row
with the accessibility and Start buttons. Small tablets in portrait just
cross 600dp (Teclast P80: 800x1280 at 213 dpi, w601dp), so the buttons
take almost the whole row and "Welcome to LineageOS" wraps into a narrow
column of word fragments. Switch to the wide layout and its larger title
from the expanded width class (840dp, e.g. the same tablet in landscape)
instead; narrower screens keep the regular layout.
---
diff --git a/app/src/main/res/layout-w600dp/welcome_activity.xml b/app/src/main/res/layout-w840dp/welcome_activity.xml
similarity index 100%
rename from app/src/main/res/layout-w600dp/welcome_activity.xml
rename to app/src/main/res/layout-w840dp/welcome_activity.xml
diff --git a/app/src/main/res/values-w600dp-h480dp/dimens.xml b/app/src/main/res/values-w840dp-h480dp/dimens.xml
similarity index 100%
rename from app/src/main/res/values-w600dp-h480dp/dimens.xml
rename to app/src/main/res/values-w840dp-h480dp/dimens.xml
-- 
